---
description: Hypeable UI must use the design tokens and aurora rules
alwaysApply: true
---
- All UI uses tokens from `app/styles/tokens.scss` (`--hype-*` or mapped `--bolt-elements-*`). Never raw hex in components.
- Follow `docs/DESIGN.md`.
- No CSS gradients except the Aurora atmosphere (home hero / empty states) and at most one gradient word in a heading, plus the composer focus ring.
- Logo is flat lime. Buttons are solid single colours. Status colours never use a gradient.
- Do not imitate other products' logos, colours, or copy.
